WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:03.108
[♪ opening theme song plays]

3
00:42.064 --> 00:48.070
THE PERFECT LIE

4
00:53.158 --> 00:54.743
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION

5
00:54.826 --> 00:58.080
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

6
00:58.163 --> 01:00.582
[♪ tense music plays]

7
01:19.142 --> 01:20.310
[Jisun] Did you get it?

8
01:21.561 --> 01:23.772
[rustling]

9
01:28.402 --> 01:29.861
[Junghyeon] What are you going to do with it?

10
01:35.075 --> 01:37.494
[Jisun] I'm going to make him understand what he's done.

11
01:42.624 --> 01:43.875
MIN JUNHO

12
01:43.959 --> 01:45.001
[Jisun] Let's meet.

13
01:45.752 --> 01:47.838
I want to start my life over.

14
01:48.338 --> 01:50.048
I'll do whatever you say.

15
02:02.227 --> 02:03.270
[gargling]

16
02:03.979 --> 02:04.980
[spits]

17
02:11.611 --> 02:13.530
[♪ ambient music plays]

18
02:15.073 --> 02:16.867
[Jisun yelps]

19
02:18.744 --> 02:20.120
-What the… -Oh, my gosh.

20
02:22.164 --> 02:23.415
[scoffs]

21
02:27.627 --> 02:28.712
[Jisun groans]

22
02:32.591 --> 02:34.217
Where are you going? We need to talk.

23
02:34.301 --> 02:35.302
[Junho] You're drunk.

24
02:39.264 --> 02:41.057
[♪ unsettling music plays]

25
02:48.273 --> 02:49.357
What the…

26
02:55.113 --> 02:56.114
You…

27
02:56.865 --> 02:57.908
[grunts]

28
03:03.538 --> 03:04.539
Goddamn it!

29
03:12.798 --> 03:14.007
[Junho grunts]

30
03:16.593 --> 03:17.844
Just close your eyes.

31
03:18.762 --> 03:20.722
[car starts]

32
03:20.806 --> 03:22.265
-[gearshift clicks] -[exhales sharply]

33
03:24.267 --> 03:30.398
EPISODE 6 THE VICTIMS

34
04:10.021 --> 04:11.022
[Jisun grunts]

35
04:11.106 --> 04:13.316
[♪ chilling sting]

36
04:14.067 --> 04:15.360
[Junho groans softly]

37
04:16.486 --> 04:18.071
[groans]

38
04:28.498 --> 04:30.000
[clinking]

39
04:40.135 --> 04:41.177
[gags]

40
04:42.345 --> 04:43.805
[Junho breathing heavily]

41
04:50.520 --> 04:51.771
What the hell are you doing?

42
04:52.522 --> 04:53.523
What?

43
04:54.024 --> 04:56.234
You don't like it now that the tables have turned?

44
04:58.445 --> 05:00.572
[gags, retches]

45
05:01.531 --> 05:04.034
That'll last a few hours. That's how it works.

46
05:04.117 --> 05:05.660
[Junho breathing heavily]

47
05:11.041 --> 05:12.751
You're really doing this?

48
05:14.169 --> 05:15.170
To me?

49
05:16.338 --> 05:18.173
What makes you think I can't?

50
05:24.179 --> 05:26.181
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

51
05:28.266 --> 05:33.688
You have no idea how many times I've imagined this moment.

52
05:38.902 --> 05:40.445
[box cutter clicks]

53
05:50.330 --> 05:51.706
Having fun?

54
05:53.625 --> 05:55.377
Turning into a perpetrator for a change?

55
05:57.212 --> 05:58.588
I thought it'd be fun.

56
06:00.006 --> 06:01.591
But I just feel even more disgusted.

57
06:02.759 --> 06:04.511
Don't you still have a lot of questions?

58
06:07.472 --> 06:09.724
You haven't heard anything directly from me yet.

59
06:10.684 --> 06:12.644
[♪ tense music plays]

60
06:12.727 --> 06:13.979
[box cutter clicks]

61
06:17.315 --> 06:18.441
[Jisun] That night…

62
06:19.401 --> 06:20.819
You chose a day with heavy rain,

63
06:20.902 --> 06:23.113
so you'd have an excuse to come in, didn't you?

64
06:23.655 --> 06:25.240
[laughs]

65
06:28.785 --> 06:30.328
You're out of your mind.

66
06:31.287 --> 06:33.748
Yeah, laugh while you still can.

67
06:36.918 --> 06:38.837
I guess that's just human nature.

68
06:38.920 --> 06:41.381
You never really understand what someone's going through

69
06:41.464 --> 06:43.216
until you experience it yourself.

70
06:48.763 --> 06:50.640
I searched online

71
06:51.433 --> 06:54.811
for ways to deal with you and what kind of punishment you deserve.

72
06:55.854 --> 06:57.856
I thought I'd tap into the collective wisdom.

73
07:00.275 --> 07:03.236
Turns out there are so many people who've been through what I have.

74
07:04.070 --> 07:05.989
People who couldn't report it,

75
07:06.072 --> 07:07.949
or who did but ended up hurt all over again

76
07:08.032 --> 07:09.826
because the punishment was so lenient.

77
07:11.453 --> 07:12.662
Minors.

78
07:14.873 --> 07:16.332
A lot of men too.

79
07:19.210 --> 07:20.545
They say it's crucial to help.

80
07:21.880 --> 07:23.923
That if they can't bring themselves to do it…

81
07:26.634 --> 07:28.887
-you have to get rid of… -[box cutter clicks]

82
07:30.013 --> 07:31.473
…the root of the problem for them.

83
07:35.310 --> 07:37.061
[♪ ominous music plays]

84
07:37.145 --> 07:38.396
[Junho breathing shakily]

85
07:40.148 --> 07:41.775
You remember what you did, don't you?

86
07:41.858 --> 07:43.026
DEAR MY FRIEND IS NOW OPEN

87
07:43.109 --> 07:46.362
One person is dead, and the other can't live a normal life anymore.

88
07:48.239 --> 07:51.159
Ms. Kim Jeongmi couldn't even report what you did to her.

89
07:51.242 --> 07:55.538
She blames herself for her friend's death and lives like she's the guilty one.

90
08:07.509 --> 08:09.260
LOCATION DETAILS

91
08:30.490 --> 08:32.700
CAPTAIN

92
08:35.620 --> 08:37.455
-[team leader] Hello? -Hello, sir.

93
08:38.623 --> 08:40.250
It's nothing urgent.

94
08:40.333 --> 08:42.043
I just wanted to keep you in the loop.

95
08:43.044 --> 08:46.047
It's just that Min Junho's location is a bit…

96
08:46.131 --> 08:47.340
[team leader] What about his location?

97
08:49.884 --> 08:51.678
I'm just getting a bad feeling.

98
08:54.722 --> 08:56.307
[car unlocks]

99
08:59.686 --> 09:01.229
[phone buzzing]

100
09:02.105 --> 09:04.149
INCOMING CALL MY HUSBAND

101
09:06.359 --> 09:08.570
Yeah, I'm on my way home.

102
09:09.696 --> 09:12.115
I'll be home soon, so I'll make sure to get some rest.

103
09:14.367 --> 09:17.120
Okay. You too, honey.

104
09:20.123 --> 09:21.583
[call disconnects]

105
09:22.125 --> 09:24.043
[♪ unsettling music plays]

106
09:28.798 --> 09:30.300
How did Ms. Joo Eunhye die?

107
09:34.512 --> 09:37.182
I had a patient who took their own life with drugs.

108
09:38.516 --> 09:42.854
I told Eunhye exactly how that patient did it.

109
09:48.109 --> 09:50.069
So she wouldn't fail.

110
09:51.321 --> 09:54.115
I didn't think she'd actually go through with it, to be honest.

111
09:56.659 --> 09:59.162
I was a little surprised when she pulled it off.

112
10:01.456 --> 10:02.832
Why?

113
10:02.916 --> 10:04.626
Why would you do that to your own wife?

114
10:07.086 --> 10:08.880
Because that's what she wanted.

115
10:10.215 --> 10:11.216
What?

116
10:12.842 --> 10:15.094
[Junho] When I told her what I'd done…

117
10:17.055 --> 10:19.557
with her friend…

118
10:23.645 --> 10:26.356
-The look on her face-- -You drove her to take her own life.

119
10:26.439 --> 10:27.815
No.

120
10:27.899 --> 10:32.320
That was the bravest thing Eunhye did in her life.

121
10:34.197 --> 10:38.493
And I was the only one who understood and respected her decision.

122
10:38.576 --> 10:41.996
You deliberately used GHB to make Kim Jeongmi your victim,

123
10:42.580 --> 10:47.627
just to push Eunhye into ending her life sooner.

124
10:51.089 --> 10:52.423
What are you talking about?

125
10:52.966 --> 10:55.176
-I'm not that kind of person. -Liar.

126
10:58.429 --> 11:00.181
Isn't this what you wanted to hear?

127
11:02.267 --> 11:04.727
-You're recording all this, right? -[scoffs] You piece of trash.

128
11:05.270 --> 11:09.816
Kang Jisun, how about you act a little more mature, huh?

129
11:12.068 --> 11:14.904
I'm not going to make the same mistake this time.

130
11:15.905 --> 11:17.156
"This time"?

131
11:17.240 --> 11:19.659
At first, I thought it would be simple.

132
11:22.412 --> 11:25.123
I thought all I had to do was tell the truth, but I was wrong.

133
11:25.206 --> 11:28.334
So this time, I'm going to be the one lying.

134
11:28.418 --> 11:31.254
I'll say you brought me here.

135
11:33.423 --> 11:36.551
-Who's going to believe that? -Plenty of people saw us at the bar.

136
11:36.634 --> 11:38.803
Min Junho!

137
11:38.886 --> 11:43.891
I'll call the police early in the morning and show them the rope marks on my wrists.

138
11:43.975 --> 11:45.685
I don't even know where we are.

139
11:45.768 --> 11:47.687
They'll find GHB in your car too.

140
11:47.770 --> 11:51.357
I'll say you got that wound on your neck when I tried to escape,

141
11:51.441 --> 11:55.403
and that I somehow managed to knock you down and tie you up.

142
11:59.490 --> 12:01.576
So now, you're going to take one hard hit.

143
12:03.119 --> 12:04.537
-[♪ tense music plays] -Would that make you feel better?

144
12:04.620 --> 12:06.664
Not nearly enough to make up for what you did.

145
12:06.748 --> 12:09.292
You sold your dignity for a mere five million won,

146
12:09.876 --> 12:13.421
in exchange for putting up with Principal Jeong's sexual harassment.

147
12:15.131 --> 12:18.134
-I wasn't the one who took the money. -But you didn't give it back.

148
12:18.926 --> 12:22.138
You put a price on the pain and suffering you endured.

149
12:23.598 --> 12:24.932
In the end…

150
12:27.143 --> 12:29.228
you sold your self-respect for five million won.

151
12:29.979 --> 12:31.230
Don't be ridiculous!

152
12:32.774 --> 12:33.816
[Jisun groans]

153
12:36.069 --> 12:37.403
[Junho grunts]

154
12:38.738 --> 12:39.864
[objects clatter]

155
12:40.448 --> 12:41.616
[Junho] Unfortunately for you,

156
12:42.658 --> 12:44.869
I think we both know how this is going to end.

157
12:56.756 --> 12:58.132
You're not getting away.

158
13:02.136 --> 13:03.638
[object clatters]

159
13:03.721 --> 13:05.098
[running footsteps fade]

160
13:08.476 --> 13:09.519
[car unlocks]

161
13:09.602 --> 13:10.728
[Jisun yelps]

162
13:14.607 --> 13:15.817
Damn it.

163
13:28.454 --> 13:29.580
Damn it.

164
14:33.227 --> 14:35.271
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

165
14:38.149 --> 14:39.984
[Jisun grunting]

166
14:42.069 --> 14:44.530
[car honking]

167
14:46.032 --> 14:48.451
[grunting]

168
14:49.952 --> 14:51.370
Ms. Kang!

169
14:52.663 --> 14:55.583
Help me! He tried to kill me!

170
14:58.002 --> 14:59.086
Help me.

171
14:59.170 --> 15:00.755
She's lying, Detective.

172
15:00.838 --> 15:03.216
She drugged me and dragged me all the way here

173
15:03.299 --> 15:05.384
to make it look like I planned the whole thing.

174
15:07.303 --> 15:09.722
[♪ ominous music plays]

175
15:23.778 --> 15:28.324
How am I supposed to believe a man who drugs and sexually assaults women?

176
15:40.503 --> 15:42.630
Do you have any evidence, Detective?

177
15:42.713 --> 15:44.548
You saw him attack me, didn't you?

178
15:44.632 --> 15:47.009
-Arrest him, now! -She's the one who held me captive

179
15:47.093 --> 15:49.387
and attacked me first. I was acting in self-defense.

180
15:50.012 --> 15:51.180
If you don't believe me…

181
15:52.932 --> 15:54.392
go ahead and arrest me right now.

182
16:03.025 --> 16:04.694
[Jisun] What are you doing?

183
16:05.486 --> 16:07.697
-You're just letting him go? -If we arrest him now

184
16:07.780 --> 16:09.615
and a drug test comes back positive,

185
16:10.533 --> 16:12.034
you'll be the one in trouble.

186
16:22.545 --> 16:24.422
I swear I'll catch you!

187
16:25.589 --> 16:28.175
I'll find proof that you sexually assaulted me!

188
16:28.259 --> 16:29.844
I swear I will!

189
16:35.891 --> 16:37.727
[♪ chilling music plays]

190
16:40.896 --> 16:42.815
I didn't do anything wrong.

191
16:45.026 --> 16:47.236
I think you've got it all wrong.

192
16:51.157 --> 16:52.241
[scoffs]

193
17:18.601 --> 17:20.561
[♪ ominous music plays]

194
17:21.562 --> 17:22.772
[Jisun] Back then, I…

195
17:29.278 --> 17:32.448
I guess I cursed you when I said you'd understand if it happened to you.

196
17:35.868 --> 17:37.078
Ms. Kang.

197
17:39.747 --> 17:42.708
Thanks to your call that morning,

198
17:44.085 --> 17:46.087
I got the drug test.

199
17:48.923 --> 17:50.716
If it hadn't been for you,

200
17:52.134 --> 17:54.845
I never would've known something like that had happened to me…

201
17:56.055 --> 17:58.724
or that Min Junho was the one who did it.

202
18:10.152 --> 18:11.362
I'm sorry…

203
18:15.741 --> 18:17.451
for making you fight this battle alone.

204
18:20.663 --> 18:22.540
But now, when it comes to Min Junho…

205
18:24.125 --> 18:25.876
you're not alone anymore.

206
18:36.887 --> 18:38.264
Are you going to be okay?

207
19:29.023 --> 19:30.816
[glass thuds]

208
19:30.900 --> 19:33.402
[breathes heavily]

209
19:33.486 --> 19:34.487
[Hyunsoo] Dad?

210
19:36.447 --> 19:37.448
Hey.

211
19:39.116 --> 19:40.201
Did I wake you?

212
19:40.284 --> 19:41.619
Why are you home so late?

213
19:42.912 --> 19:46.040
Well, things just keep coming up lately.

214
19:47.666 --> 19:49.293
[liquid pouring]

215
19:55.883 --> 19:56.884
Hyunsoo.

216
20:01.722 --> 20:02.932
It looks like I'm going to…

217
20:04.099 --> 20:06.143
get questioned by the police again.

218
20:06.894 --> 20:08.270
Why?

219
20:08.896 --> 20:11.607
They're saying I committed another crime.

220
20:12.650 --> 20:14.193
But that's ridiculous.

221
20:14.276 --> 20:16.237
Why do they keep doing this?

222
20:16.320 --> 20:18.864
I guess they're desperate to make me out to be a criminal,

223
20:20.157 --> 20:22.243
even if they have to frame me.

224
20:22.326 --> 20:24.495
Then you just have to prove you didn't do it.

225
20:33.546 --> 20:34.630
That day…

226
20:36.090 --> 20:38.592
I went for a walk by myself.

227
20:38.676 --> 20:39.760
[♪ ominous music plays]

228
20:39.844 --> 20:41.971
[Junho] The day the police are talking about.

229
20:44.014 --> 20:45.766
You were home, Hyunsoo.

230
20:48.102 --> 20:49.186
So…

231
20:51.397 --> 20:54.191
it's hard for me to prove I didn't do anything wrong.

232
20:56.193 --> 20:57.903
But you didn't do anything wrong.

233
21:00.739 --> 21:05.703
These people wouldn't think twice about putting me in prison.

234
21:09.081 --> 21:10.666
[Junho sighs]

235
21:10.749 --> 21:12.376
If I get arrested…

236
21:14.044 --> 21:16.338
everything I've worked so hard for…

237
21:21.427 --> 21:23.012
Even you, Hyunsoo…

238
21:26.432 --> 21:28.684
The thought of losing it all is tearing me apart.

239
21:32.938 --> 21:35.608
What if I tell them I was with you that day, Dad?

240
21:36.859 --> 21:37.860
You can't.

241
21:37.943 --> 21:40.487
You lied to help Soyeon back then too.

242
21:42.615 --> 21:44.533
You said it was a white lie.

243
21:46.744 --> 21:48.287
I want to help you too.

244
21:55.794 --> 21:57.087
[Junho sighs]

245
22:00.507 --> 22:02.718
You said family is supposed to protect each other.

246
22:05.638 --> 22:07.765
I can't make you lie too.

247
22:08.390 --> 22:09.433
I'm going to do it.

248
22:10.768 --> 22:13.103
I won't let them take you away.

249
22:17.274 --> 22:18.692
I love you, my son.

250
22:26.742 --> 22:28.160
[sighs]

251
22:34.625 --> 22:35.751
Sir?

252
22:38.128 --> 22:39.380
Sir.

253
22:39.463 --> 22:40.589
Oh, hey.

254
22:41.256 --> 22:42.549
You're here early.

255
22:43.258 --> 22:44.551
Can we talk for a minute?

256
22:48.847 --> 22:50.307
So, because there's no evidence…

257
22:52.142 --> 22:55.813
you're telling me to keep my mouth shut, take some time off, and stay out of it?

258
22:55.896 --> 22:58.315
I'm saying we need to think this through carefully.

259
22:58.399 --> 22:59.525
This isn't just…

260
23:00.776 --> 23:02.111
a personal matter.

261
23:02.194 --> 23:03.529
[scoffs]

262
23:03.612 --> 23:07.866
Look, it's a sensitive time with performance reviews coming up.

263
23:08.784 --> 23:11.954
People are already saying there's been a lack of discipline.

264
23:12.037 --> 23:15.207
If this goes south, it'll take everyone from the top down with it.

265
23:15.791 --> 23:18.335
So the higher-ups think delaying or covering it up

266
23:18.419 --> 23:20.337
will help their chances of getting promoted.

267
23:20.421 --> 23:22.172
Oh, come on.

268
23:22.256 --> 23:24.508
They were furious when they heard about this.

269
23:26.593 --> 23:28.679
What does he take the police for?

270
23:29.179 --> 23:32.391
They're determined to get that bastard when the time comes.

271
23:32.474 --> 23:34.309
But what if something goes wrong

272
23:35.144 --> 23:39.106
and those vultures in the press get wind of it?

273
23:39.690 --> 23:41.233
They'll say a female police officer

274
23:41.316 --> 23:43.902
couldn't even protect herself, let alone catch the suspect.

275
23:43.986 --> 23:46.030
They'll question whether she's even fit to be--

276
23:46.113 --> 23:47.281
Sir!

277
23:49.199 --> 23:51.910
I'm saying some lunatic might go around talking like that.

278
23:55.622 --> 23:57.583
You're about to become a mother.

279
23:59.043 --> 24:01.795
The higher-ups are trying to protect you.

280
24:04.631 --> 24:06.216
I'll keep it quiet.

281
24:07.176 --> 24:08.886
And you never told me to take time off.

282
24:12.347 --> 24:14.308
-[♪ tense music plays] -This case…

283
24:14.391 --> 24:16.226
We're not covering it up.

284
24:16.310 --> 24:17.811
I promise. Trust me, okay?

285
24:20.064 --> 24:21.607
[exhales sharply] Even when I'm trying to sleep,

286
24:21.690 --> 24:23.734
the thought of that bastard just…

287
24:25.277 --> 24:27.571
I have a daughter of my own too, you know.

288
24:29.823 --> 24:33.285
Wait. Nothing happened last night, right?

289
24:37.164 --> 24:38.415
No.

290
24:38.499 --> 24:39.541
Nothing happened.

291
24:40.876 --> 24:45.214
Just focus on taking care of yourself until the baby's born, got it?

292
24:58.393 --> 24:59.645
[sighs]

293
25:38.016 --> 25:40.519
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

294
25:52.739 --> 25:53.991
[gasps]

295
26:21.268 --> 26:22.769
ANTI-ANXIETY MEDICATION

296
26:26.148 --> 26:27.691
[liquid pouring]

297
26:33.155 --> 26:34.198
[sighs]

298
26:43.123 --> 26:44.374
[unfolds phone]

299
26:46.126 --> 26:47.586
[call connects]

300
26:49.338 --> 26:51.590
Min Junho isn't going to just let this go.

301
26:52.257 --> 26:54.551
He'll find some way to get back at me.

302
26:54.635 --> 26:57.763
It's natural to feel unsafe when the crime happened in your own home

303
26:57.846 --> 26:59.473
or the perpetrator lives nearby.

304
26:59.556 --> 27:01.433
And it can actually be dangerous too.

305
27:02.601 --> 27:05.771
So you're telling me to move or something?

306
27:06.813 --> 27:08.732
Of course, it's up to you.

307
27:09.233 --> 27:11.652
It's not running away. It's about protecting yourself.

308
27:11.735 --> 27:13.445
You can't afford to lose your strength.

309
27:20.118 --> 27:21.453
What about you?

310
27:22.037 --> 27:23.872
I'm a police officer, you know.

311
27:25.624 --> 27:26.875
For now,

312
27:26.959 --> 27:29.753
just focus on protecting yourself and regain some peace of mind.

313
27:29.836 --> 27:32.339
We're going to get Min Junho.

314
27:33.590 --> 27:36.301
Because he won't be able to stop himself from doing it again.

315
27:37.970 --> 27:39.096
[call disconnects]

316
27:52.776 --> 27:54.861
CCTV RECORDING IN PROGRESS CONTINUOUS RECORDING

317
27:55.696 --> 27:58.407
[attorney] We're more than happy to cooperate with the police,

318
27:59.241 --> 28:02.452
but questioning him as a witness without even telling us what it's about…

319
28:03.745 --> 28:05.539
I'm not too thrilled about that.

320
28:06.707 --> 28:09.960
We're just trying to rule out the possibility of false testimony.

321
28:10.794 --> 28:15.590
As you know, he's a minor who could be influenced by his guardian.

322
28:17.676 --> 28:19.761
So you're saying his guardian can't be trusted?

323
28:24.558 --> 28:26.226
Just tell me what you remember.

324
28:26.893 --> 28:28.186
Only the truth.

325
28:31.148 --> 28:34.443
Do you remember the day your mom died?

326
28:34.526 --> 28:35.777
[attorney] Hold on a second.

327
28:38.030 --> 28:40.699
Is that question actually relevant to your investigation?

328
28:40.782 --> 28:43.952
It may or may not be, depending on his answer.

329
28:46.997 --> 28:48.832
He's a child who needs to be protected.

330
28:48.915 --> 28:50.459
That's a sensitive personal matter.

331
28:51.209 --> 28:54.588
If necessary, we can reschedule with a child psychologist present.

332
28:58.550 --> 28:59.968
Let me ask you again.

333
29:02.054 --> 29:06.767
Can you tell me what you did after school last Thursday?

334
29:10.687 --> 29:12.147
I went straight home.

335
29:15.233 --> 29:17.152
I borrowed a book from the library that day…

336
29:20.238 --> 29:21.281
so I read it…

337
29:23.825 --> 29:25.702
and had dinner with my dad.

338
29:28.163 --> 29:29.831
Do you remember the title of the book?

339
29:34.252 --> 29:35.796
Fabre's Book of Insects.

340
29:40.425 --> 29:41.468
-[chuckles] -[scribbling]

341
29:43.136 --> 29:45.931
But doesn't your dad scold you if you play video games?

342
29:46.014 --> 29:48.225
I played with my headset on so he wouldn't know.

343
29:48.308 --> 29:49.309
[Hwayoung] Hmm.

344
29:50.018 --> 29:52.187
What was your dad doing at the time?

345
30:03.115 --> 30:04.741
He was in his room.

346
30:06.284 --> 30:08.078
He didn't leave the house?

347
30:08.161 --> 30:09.913
Not even for a little while?

348
30:11.581 --> 30:12.582
No.

349
30:13.792 --> 30:15.961
Maybe you were too busy gaming to notice?

350
30:18.964 --> 30:20.048
Let me ask you again.

351
30:21.341 --> 30:23.802
How do you know your dad didn't go out?

352
30:24.636 --> 30:27.430
-I didn't hear him leave. -But you said you had your headset on.

353
30:29.558 --> 30:30.851
You don't have to answer.

354
30:32.561 --> 30:34.813
Those are leading questions, don't you think?

355
30:38.275 --> 30:39.860
After I was done playing…

356
30:44.239 --> 30:45.699
at around 10:00 p.m…

357
30:47.159 --> 30:49.161
I got thirsty, so I stepped out for a minute.

358
30:52.956 --> 30:57.210
Dad was closing the curtains, and he asked if I'd brushed my teeth.

359
31:01.882 --> 31:02.883
I see.

360
31:04.092 --> 31:05.093
All right.

361
31:07.095 --> 31:09.431
Do you remember the last time you saw your mom?

362
31:09.514 --> 31:10.640
[attorney] What are you doing?

363
31:10.724 --> 31:11.975
[Hwayoung] Hyunsoo has a good memory,

364
31:12.058 --> 31:14.769
so I figured he'd remember what happened three years ago.

365
31:14.853 --> 31:16.146
It wasn't in the records.

366
31:16.229 --> 31:18.273
I thought we wouldn't be asking irrelevant--

367
31:18.356 --> 31:20.525
I decide what's relevant to the case.

368
31:27.824 --> 31:29.826
The day your mom died,

369
31:29.910 --> 31:31.161
was anyone at home?

370
31:33.205 --> 31:34.247
[sighs]

371
31:35.790 --> 31:36.917
No.

372
31:37.834 --> 31:39.669
-I was out. -What about your dad?

373
31:39.753 --> 31:42.589
-Detective. -Hyunsoo, just tell me what you saw.

374
31:42.672 --> 31:44.216
-[attorney] Don't answer. -Answer me, Hyunsoo.

375
31:44.299 --> 31:45.300
[team leader] Inspector Lee!

376
31:47.344 --> 31:49.846
That's enough. Thanks for coming in. You can go now.

377
31:49.930 --> 31:51.097
Hyunsoo, let's go. Get up.

378
31:55.435 --> 31:56.519
[door opens]

379
31:58.313 --> 31:59.481
[door closes]

380
32:00.857 --> 32:02.901
What are you doing? You didn't report this.

381
32:02.984 --> 32:05.654
I was just questioning a witness, following proper procedure.

382
32:08.365 --> 32:10.116
[team leader sighs]

383
32:18.750 --> 32:20.585
-Is Mom sleeping? -[door closes]

384
32:21.211 --> 32:23.213
Mom's not feeling well right now.

385
32:24.297 --> 32:26.174
Why don't you go play at the playground?

386
32:27.133 --> 32:28.134
Can I ride my bike?

387
32:29.469 --> 32:30.470
Sure.

388
32:34.349 --> 32:35.350
But…

389
32:37.018 --> 32:39.771
I promised Mom I'd show her this.

390
32:42.190 --> 32:43.483
I'll show it to her for you.

391
32:58.498 --> 33:00.375
[♪ sinister music plays]

392
33:38.580 --> 33:39.664
Your phone.

393
33:42.083 --> 33:43.460
Where's yours?

394
33:43.543 --> 33:46.004
I already told you. My account got suspended.

395
33:59.351 --> 34:00.477
It sold!

396
34:01.770 --> 34:03.646
Did you sell another pair of knockoffs?

397
34:03.730 --> 34:04.981
Yeah.

398
34:05.065 --> 34:07.692
-What if you get caught again? -I won't.

399
34:07.776 --> 34:08.860
[scoffs]

400
34:09.569 --> 34:11.529
The buyer specifically asked for knockoffs.

401
34:12.197 --> 34:13.907
Isn't that illegal too?

402
34:13.990 --> 34:16.993
Oh, please. By that logic, every adult would be a criminal.

403
34:17.827 --> 34:19.621
Is this how you're going to live your life?

404
34:19.704 --> 34:23.124
No, I'm going to be a famous K-pop idol.

405
34:23.208 --> 34:25.335
What if you end up in jail before you become one?

406
34:39.849 --> 34:42.060
Why is that any of your business?

407
34:42.143 --> 34:45.230
[Junghyeon] Hey, I'm the one who got you the GHB.

408
34:45.313 --> 34:48.608
Don't you think you should talk to me before deciding to give up the fight?

409
34:50.235 --> 34:54.656
And if you're going to take him on, you're going to need someone like me.

410
34:54.739 --> 34:55.865
I appreciate it.

411
34:56.699 --> 34:59.035
But the best way you can help is to stay out of this.

412
35:00.453 --> 35:04.332
You still have to see him at the hospital, so just pretend you don't know anything.

413
35:04.416 --> 35:07.043
How can I just pretend I don't know when I'm so furious?

414
35:07.544 --> 35:10.714
It's bad enough that you lost your job. Why should you have to move too?

415
35:14.134 --> 35:15.301
That's enough.

416
35:15.385 --> 35:17.345
If you keep talking, I'm going to get angry.

417
35:19.013 --> 35:20.181
Okay, okay.

418
35:30.108 --> 35:31.568
[seat belt unbuckles]

419
35:35.822 --> 35:37.240
-Huh? -[clattering]

420
35:38.408 --> 35:40.744
This looks just like the one I bought Uyeong.

421
35:44.080 --> 35:47.250
UYEONG

422
35:48.001 --> 35:50.420
Is this my sister's?

423
35:51.838 --> 35:53.757
She must've left it in my car by accident.

424
35:54.716 --> 35:58.136
She was getting wet in the rain the other day, so I gave her a ride.

425
35:59.304 --> 36:01.556
Why was she getting wet when she had an umbrella?

426
36:03.892 --> 36:07.187
It's a kids' umbrella, so it's too small. She was walking all hunched over.

427
36:07.896 --> 36:10.565
Your sister was worried sick about you when you disappeared.

428
36:12.692 --> 36:14.861
[sighs] Look, I'm sure you didn't want to

429
36:14.944 --> 36:17.238
turn your phone off and disappear like that.

430
36:18.114 --> 36:19.949
You must've been going through hell.

431
36:20.033 --> 36:21.034
I get it.

432
36:24.746 --> 36:27.457
I was just trying to remember if it rained that day…

433
36:30.043 --> 36:31.544
but it didn't.

434
36:32.879 --> 36:34.839
It must've been another day then.

435
36:34.923 --> 36:36.966
Anyway, we were all really worried.

436
36:39.052 --> 36:40.053
[Jisun] Okay.

437
36:41.012 --> 36:42.680
I'll give this back to her.

438
36:42.764 --> 36:43.807
Sure.

439
36:59.697 --> 37:01.157
[clattering]

440
37:03.535 --> 37:05.036
[tapping on phone]

441
37:05.912 --> 37:07.747
[call connects]

442
37:08.331 --> 37:09.624
[automated voice] The call cannot be connected…

443
37:09.707 --> 37:11.209
[door lock beeps]

444
37:11.918 --> 37:14.921
-[♪ tense music plays] -[beeping continues]

445
37:17.423 --> 37:18.633
[beeping stops]

446
37:18.716 --> 37:20.176
[door unlocks]

447
37:21.761 --> 37:22.762
[door closes]

448
37:24.222 --> 37:25.431
[spouse] Ta-da!

449
37:27.058 --> 37:28.852
Wait, hold on.

450
37:28.935 --> 37:30.061
[clears throat]

451
37:30.812 --> 37:32.730
Park Seokgu, son of the motherland,

452
37:32.814 --> 37:35.817
reporting for duty to my wife, Lee Hwayoung!

453
37:35.900 --> 37:37.861
Ma'am!

454
37:39.529 --> 37:40.530
[chuckles]

455
37:41.239 --> 37:43.366
What's this? Where's my hug?

456
37:44.075 --> 37:45.451
Come on!

457
37:47.245 --> 37:48.955
[Seokgu laughs]

458
37:49.038 --> 37:50.582
How have you been?

459
37:52.458 --> 37:53.626
[soup simmering]

460
37:53.710 --> 37:55.503
[Seokgu] Honey, what's that smell?

461
37:56.254 --> 37:58.590
Are you kidding me? Why did you make so much?

462
37:58.673 --> 37:59.883
Looks good, doesn't it?

463
37:59.966 --> 38:02.886
You should've just made a little. It must've been a lot of work.

464
38:02.969 --> 38:04.804
-[Hwayoung] Eat up. -[Seokgu chuckles]

465
38:06.222 --> 38:07.891
What? Aren't you eating with me?

466
38:10.393 --> 38:11.769
I ate earlier.

467
38:11.853 --> 38:13.563
My stomach's a little upset right now.

468
38:13.646 --> 38:15.231
[Seokgu] Hey, seriously?

469
38:15.315 --> 38:16.816
Come on.

470
38:16.900 --> 38:17.984
Come sit with me.

471
38:18.067 --> 38:19.402
There we go.

472
38:20.111 --> 38:21.821
Please have a seat.

473
38:21.905 --> 38:24.449
[chair slides]

474
38:30.622 --> 38:34.000
[sighs] At least let me look at you while I eat.

475
38:34.083 --> 38:35.251
Please.

476
38:37.128 --> 38:38.588
Thanks for the food.

477
38:39.380 --> 38:41.716
[chuckles] Looks delicious.

478
38:55.188 --> 38:57.065
-Hmm? -[door slides]

479
38:58.900 --> 39:00.485
[Hwayoung] You must be tired.

480
39:00.568 --> 39:02.028
You can have the bed to yourself.

481
39:02.111 --> 39:03.112
Where are you going?

482
39:04.364 --> 39:06.074
I don't want to make you uncomfortable.

483
39:06.658 --> 39:08.242
We still have to be careful.

484
39:10.411 --> 39:13.373
I'm sorry, honey. Give me that.

485
39:13.456 --> 39:15.833
No, you sleep here. I'll sleep on the couch.

486
39:15.917 --> 39:17.251
Go on, get some rest.

487
39:25.009 --> 39:27.178
[♪ unsettling music plays]

488
39:41.859 --> 39:43.486
[machine whirring]

489
40:18.354 --> 40:20.690
[♪ stealthy bassline plays]

490
40:50.720 --> 40:53.556
[Hyeongsu groans] This is ridiculous.

491
40:53.639 --> 40:56.309
That bastard should be the one moving, not you.

492
40:57.602 --> 40:59.353
I guess this is as far as I can go.

493
41:00.688 --> 41:03.524
I'm sorry for making you worry so much.

494
41:06.402 --> 41:08.488
I'll find you a lawyer at a top law firm.

495
41:09.030 --> 41:10.907
How about we take him on in a civil suit?

496
41:10.990 --> 41:13.451
That's not what we should be talking about right now.

497
41:13.534 --> 41:14.786
[Hyeongsu] Why not?

498
41:14.869 --> 41:17.705
We shouldn't be letting that bastard get away with it.

499
41:17.789 --> 41:18.790
[Jieun] What about her life?

500
41:18.873 --> 41:21.584
How long is she supposed to let this case consume her?

501
41:23.503 --> 41:24.504
[Hyeongsu] But…

502
41:28.132 --> 41:29.634
Go check on the kids.

503
41:29.717 --> 41:32.095
They've been too quiet. They might be up to something.

504
41:32.762 --> 41:35.556
Still, whatever you decide to do,

505
41:37.225 --> 41:38.726
you have my full support.

506
41:40.561 --> 41:42.438
Yes. Thank you.

507
41:44.649 --> 41:46.317
[Hyeongsu sighs]

508
41:48.152 --> 41:49.403
[Hyeongsu] Geez.

509
41:59.247 --> 42:01.290
Are you sure you're going to be okay?

510
42:06.337 --> 42:09.090
I wanted to put everything back the way it was.

511
42:13.761 --> 42:17.140
But like you said, I need to take care of myself first.

512
42:19.308 --> 42:22.145
Instead of starting over somewhere new again,

513
42:22.228 --> 42:24.480
why don't you just move in with us?

514
42:26.440 --> 42:29.402
Everywhere I go around here, I'm reminded of what happened.

515
42:29.485 --> 42:30.987
I feel like I can't breathe.

516
42:36.617 --> 42:37.618
I feel like…

517
42:38.786 --> 42:41.038
I haven't been of much help to you.

518
42:41.122 --> 42:42.874
I'm really sorry.

519
42:45.001 --> 42:46.210
What are you talking about?

520
42:46.294 --> 42:48.671
I couldn't have made it this far without you.

521
42:52.008 --> 42:53.050
Thanks.

522
42:59.432 --> 43:00.433
Oh, right.

523
43:00.516 --> 43:02.977
Junghyeon gave me Uyeong's umbrella.

524
43:07.273 --> 43:09.901
Oh, that. You can give it to me later.

525
43:09.984 --> 43:10.985
[Jisun] Okay.

526
43:15.781 --> 43:18.034
[door lock beeping]

527
43:18.117 --> 43:19.202
[door unlocks]

528
43:20.411 --> 43:22.288
[Seokgu, singsongy] She's here.

529
43:22.371 --> 43:24.749
Here she is.

530
43:24.832 --> 43:26.751
Look. Ta-da!

531
43:26.834 --> 43:28.711
-What's all this? -[Seokgu chuckles]

532
43:28.794 --> 43:30.713
Look at this. Doesn't this look amazing?

533
43:30.796 --> 43:33.507
Remember how often we went to this place for chicken feet?

534
43:33.591 --> 43:34.800
You went all the way there?

535
43:34.884 --> 43:36.510
Yeah, of course.

536
43:36.594 --> 43:38.721
The owner even remembered us.

537
43:38.804 --> 43:39.972
I told him we got married,

538
43:40.056 --> 43:42.475
and he said I must've saved the country in a past life.

539
43:42.558 --> 43:46.729
So I told him, "I'm saving the country in this life too."

540
43:46.812 --> 43:48.689
This one won't be too spicy for you.

541
43:48.773 --> 43:50.608
It's the owner's special sauce.

542
43:50.691 --> 43:52.526
Even pregnant women and kids can enjoy it.

543
43:52.610 --> 43:54.987
Wow, looks delicious.

544
43:56.405 --> 43:57.907
Oh, man. This would be so good…

545
43:58.741 --> 43:59.992
with some soju.

546
44:00.076 --> 44:01.577
[chuckles]

547
44:04.288 --> 44:05.957
-Go ahead. -[Seokgu exclaims]

548
44:11.128 --> 44:13.172
I noticed you'd finished all your green juice,

549
44:13.256 --> 44:17.093
so I made you another week's worth.

550
44:19.011 --> 44:20.513
This one's yours.

551
44:22.515 --> 44:24.934
And this one's mine.

552
44:25.017 --> 44:26.269
[bottle opens]

553
44:27.770 --> 44:29.647
Oh, right.

554
44:29.730 --> 44:30.982
There was one more thing.

555
44:31.065 --> 44:32.608
Is it ready?

556
44:32.692 --> 44:33.901
There we go.

557
44:35.486 --> 44:36.487
Oh, my.

558
44:38.572 --> 44:40.533
It's ready.

559
44:41.200 --> 44:43.202
THURSDAY

560
44:46.080 --> 44:48.207
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

561
44:58.592 --> 45:00.011
Just a moment.

562
45:01.679 --> 45:02.722
[Seokgu] Huh?

563
45:03.306 --> 45:04.974
Sorry, just a moment.

564
45:07.852 --> 45:10.688
-Hey, Hwayoung. -[door opens, closes]

565
45:38.507 --> 45:40.926
[Hwayoung] Have you decided whether to move?

566
45:43.512 --> 45:44.513
[Jisun] Yes.

567
45:45.681 --> 45:47.350
I'm going to put my place up for sale.

568
45:49.769 --> 45:51.062
But…

569
45:53.564 --> 45:56.275
I want to catch Min Junho so badly.

570
45:59.862 --> 46:03.032
Whenever I'm awake, it's all I can think about.

571
46:06.452 --> 46:07.536
Me too.

572
46:12.541 --> 46:14.668
[♪ somber music plays]

573
46:14.752 --> 46:16.629
It's all I can think about.

574
46:20.341 --> 46:22.802
I guess the investigation isn't going so well again.

575
46:30.976 --> 46:32.436
Is something wrong?

576
46:50.538 --> 46:52.248
[exhales]

577
46:53.040 --> 46:54.458
[door lock beeping]

578
46:57.336 --> 46:58.462
[door unlocks]

579
47:01.841 --> 47:03.050
[door locks]

580
47:12.476 --> 47:14.145
[Seokgu] Is this your way of protesting?

581
47:18.607 --> 47:20.985
Because I left you alone early in your pregnancy?

582
47:23.154 --> 47:25.531
I'm sorry I'm late.

583
47:27.032 --> 47:28.868
Something important came up, so…

584
47:30.411 --> 47:32.621
Have you eaten?

585
47:35.458 --> 47:36.750
[sighs]

586
47:42.506 --> 47:43.549
I'm exhausted.

587
47:44.049 --> 47:45.593
I'm going to wash up and go to bed.

588
47:45.676 --> 47:47.011
[Seokgu] That's it?

589
47:52.141 --> 47:53.684
It's a confidential investigation.

590
47:55.603 --> 47:56.812
You know my job.

591
48:19.376 --> 48:20.920
Can't you just let it go?

592
48:23.756 --> 48:25.132
Why do I have to…

593
48:29.887 --> 48:32.431
You don't need to know everything about my work.

594
48:33.516 --> 48:35.726
It's not like you can solve my cases for me.

595
48:38.687 --> 48:40.689
Well, I need to know what it's about

596
48:40.773 --> 48:42.816
before we can decide if I can solve it or not.

597
48:44.235 --> 48:48.155
Fine, you don't have to tell me about your cases or investigations.

598
48:48.697 --> 48:50.950
I get that. But…

599
48:53.494 --> 48:57.957
At least tell me if you're in danger, if you're okay,

600
48:59.041 --> 49:01.335
or if there's anything I can do to help.

601
49:02.628 --> 49:06.090
That's all I'm asking. Don't shut your husband out like this.

602
49:09.176 --> 49:10.219
Get some rest.

603
49:16.767 --> 49:18.102
[sighs]

604
49:27.653 --> 49:31.574
Hyunsoo, how about we play some basketball after we eat? It's been a while.

605
49:33.617 --> 49:34.868
I have homework.

606
49:39.290 --> 49:40.291
Okay.

607
49:46.463 --> 49:47.798
Where did you go that day?

608
49:49.717 --> 49:50.718
That day?

609
49:51.302 --> 49:53.095
The day the police asked about.

610
49:58.183 --> 50:01.312
Well, I took a walk in the park

611
50:01.395 --> 50:03.022
and went for a run along the beach.

612
50:04.982 --> 50:06.150
Did you run into anyone?

613
50:10.404 --> 50:12.656
If someone saw you, they might tell the police.

614
50:18.704 --> 50:19.747
Min Hyunsoo.

615
50:20.789 --> 50:24.710
One visit to the police station, and now you're interrogating your own dad?

616
50:24.793 --> 50:25.794
Huh?

617
50:27.087 --> 50:28.714
Can you swear on my life?

618
50:34.011 --> 50:35.512
Of course.

619
50:36.180 --> 50:38.182
I could even swear in front of your mom.

620
50:43.062 --> 50:45.064
Just like I protected you,

621
50:45.648 --> 50:47.316
you've protected me.

622
50:49.485 --> 50:51.403
Why did you tell me to go out that day?

623
50:57.284 --> 50:58.327
That day?

624
51:00.204 --> 51:01.497
When Mom died.

625
51:07.169 --> 51:09.880
-Hyunsoo. -You told me to go outside and play.

626
51:13.467 --> 51:15.135
But I wanted to stay with Mom.

627
51:20.516 --> 51:23.894
Your mom wasn't feeling well that day, and you kept bothering her, so--

628
51:23.977 --> 51:26.271
-What are you talking about? -[♪ ominous music plays]

629
51:27.981 --> 51:30.067
I never bothered Mom.

630
51:38.033 --> 51:39.952
[knocks on door]

631
51:40.035 --> 51:41.537
[door opens]

632
51:51.296 --> 51:52.548
I'm sorry.

633
51:57.094 --> 51:59.096
I didn't explain to you properly

634
52:00.222 --> 52:01.849
how sick your mom was back then.

635
52:06.562 --> 52:10.524
Your mom was worried about you right up until the end.

636
52:12.484 --> 52:14.570
Even in her final moments,

637
52:15.279 --> 52:16.989
your mom loved you

638
52:18.574 --> 52:20.200
more than anything in the world.

639
52:27.332 --> 52:28.667
I see you've been struggling.

640
52:30.794 --> 52:32.171
From now on,

641
52:33.714 --> 52:36.925
don't lie no matter what, okay?

642
52:38.302 --> 52:42.389
Not even for me or your mom.

643
53:06.747 --> 53:08.749
Hey, Lieutenant Commander Park!

644
53:09.583 --> 53:11.001
Sir! [chuckles]

645
53:11.084 --> 53:12.252
Hey, look at you.

646
53:12.336 --> 53:15.088
Looks like you've caught a lot of pirates. You're looking good.

647
53:15.172 --> 53:17.633
Have you caught a lot of bad guys yourself, sir?

648
53:17.716 --> 53:19.760
Why don't you come in? You could teach my guys

649
53:19.843 --> 53:22.930
some of those fancy knife-fighting techniques before you go.

650
53:23.013 --> 53:26.099
What, so you can put me to work and take all the credit again?

651
53:26.183 --> 53:29.061
Hey, what credit? I just want to show you off.

652
53:29.144 --> 53:31.897
Come on, we're both serving our country. Would it kill you

653
53:31.980 --> 53:34.691
to make your old hometown buddy look good in front of his men?

654
53:35.275 --> 53:37.986
When you put it that way, I guess I should.

655
53:38.070 --> 53:39.696
-Let's go. -No.

656
53:40.197 --> 53:41.365
They're all out right now.

657
53:42.241 --> 53:43.325
So what brings you here?

658
53:43.408 --> 53:44.952
You're here to see Inspector Lee?

659
53:45.035 --> 53:47.246
No, I came to see you, sir.

660
53:49.414 --> 53:50.624
What for?

661
53:52.960 --> 53:55.879
Looks like something big's going on at work lately.

662
53:56.380 --> 53:59.633
Hwayoung's been acting differently, and something just feels off.

663
54:01.635 --> 54:03.929
I mean… Why?

664
54:04.012 --> 54:06.181
Did Inspector Lee say something?

665
54:06.265 --> 54:08.308
No, it's just…

666
54:09.434 --> 54:11.019
She just seems a little different.

667
54:11.103 --> 54:13.939
It started around ten days before I got back, I think.

668
54:16.900 --> 54:19.027
She's probably just exhausted.

669
54:19.111 --> 54:22.322
She's at that stage where she'd be especially sensitive.

670
54:22.406 --> 54:25.993
I did notice she was working too hard, so I told her to take some time off, but…

671
54:26.076 --> 54:27.202
[hums]

672
54:28.704 --> 54:33.125
Nothing happened with a particular case or anything, did it?

673
54:33.208 --> 54:35.377
Huh? Hold on a second.

674
54:35.460 --> 54:37.212
[tapping on phone]

675
54:37.296 --> 54:39.423
I should get back inside.

676
54:40.132 --> 54:41.925
What did you just say? A case?

677
54:42.009 --> 54:43.135
[inhales sharply]

678
54:43.844 --> 54:44.928
Well, I don't know.

679
54:47.139 --> 54:49.808
You know how stressful our job can be, right?

680
54:49.891 --> 54:52.436
Why don't you talk to her? Tell her to take some time off?

681
54:52.519 --> 54:55.731
I should get back inside. It was good to see you.

682
54:58.442 --> 54:59.610
Wait, sir!

683
55:01.528 --> 55:04.823
We should go for some octopus and soju at our usual spot sometime soon.

684
55:04.906 --> 55:06.116
Of course!

685
55:06.199 --> 55:08.243
I can't today, but I'll give you a call.

686
55:08.994 --> 55:10.621
-[Seokgu] Make sure you do. -Yeah, will do.

687
55:22.799 --> 55:23.800
[officer] Ma'am.

688
55:24.509 --> 55:26.303
I'm going to head home now.

689
55:26.386 --> 55:27.512
Yeah, sure.

690
55:40.025 --> 55:41.443
MY HUSBAND

691
55:41.526 --> 55:43.528
HAVE YOU HAD LUNCH? I'M HAVING GUKBAP

692
55:43.612 --> 55:45.030
WHAT TIME WILL YOU BE HOME?

693
55:59.419 --> 56:02.547
-[mouse clicks] -[typing]

694
56:02.631 --> 56:07.052
LEAVE REQUEST FORM PARK SEOKGU

695
56:09.137 --> 56:10.180
[sighs]

696
56:10.681 --> 56:12.766
DO YOU WANT TO SAVE THIS DOCUMENT? DON'T SAVE

697
56:13.350 --> 56:14.601
[sucks teeth]

698
56:16.520 --> 56:18.230
MOVE LEAVE REQUEST FORM TO RECYCLE BIN

699
56:18.313 --> 56:20.023
MY WIFE

700
56:20.107 --> 56:21.608
[Hwayoung] I'll be late again tonight.

701
56:23.527 --> 56:25.612
I won't be able to have dinner with you.

702
56:26.863 --> 56:28.115
I'm sorry.

703
56:34.538 --> 56:36.540
RECYCLE BIN

704
56:39.418 --> 56:41.628
LEAVE REQUEST FORM

705
56:45.966 --> 56:49.511
NARCOTICS ANALYSIS REPORT, LEE HWAYOUNG

706
56:49.594 --> 56:51.471
RESTORE

707
57:01.106 --> 57:04.776
4. RESULTS OF ANALYSIS GAMMA-HYDROXYBUTYRIC ACID, GHB

708
57:04.860 --> 57:06.236
POSITIVE

709
57:06.319 --> 57:08.071
[♪ tense music plays]

710
57:18.457 --> 57:20.208
[Jisun] You post your personal information here,

711
57:20.292 --> 57:23.837
change your profile picture, and wait for a response.

712
57:23.920 --> 57:26.715
Once you're verified, they send you the dark web address.

713
57:28.550 --> 57:30.427
Apparently, the address, the prices,

714
57:30.510 --> 57:33.221
and even the delivery methods change all the time.

715
57:36.266 --> 57:39.811
So this is how Mr. Park Junghyeon bought GHB?

716
57:40.604 --> 57:41.605
[sighs]

717
57:42.105 --> 57:44.691
If we actually catch the people distributing it this way,

718
57:45.317 --> 57:47.152
do you think we'll get a list of buyers?

719
57:48.028 --> 57:49.696
Even if there is one,

720
57:49.780 --> 57:51.907
there's no guarantee Min Junho will be on it.

721
57:51.990 --> 57:52.991
It's a start.

722
57:53.992 --> 57:56.369
Given the nature of this area,

723
57:56.453 --> 57:59.539
there's a good chance both the sellers and buyers live nearby.

724
58:00.123 --> 58:03.460
[sighs] Please, let us get lucky on the first try.

725
58:03.543 --> 58:06.171
We just need to find something, even the smallest lead,

726
58:06.254 --> 58:08.590
so that we can apply for a search warrant.

727
58:09.508 --> 58:10.967
I'll do whatever I can to help.

728
58:12.260 --> 58:14.471
But nothing dangerous like last time.

729
58:15.013 --> 58:20.185
Don't ever forget you promised me you'd never provoke Min Junho again.

730
58:37.536 --> 58:38.787
[clattering]

731
59:04.104 --> 59:05.647
Does your husband know?

732
59:19.494 --> 59:23.957
I thought I'd tell him once the case was solved, but…

733
59:26.126 --> 59:27.669
I don't think I can.

734
59:30.547 --> 59:32.424
I can't bear the thought of watching him…

735
59:34.759 --> 59:36.136
get his heart broken.

736
59:36.219 --> 59:37.596
I had no idea Min Junho

737
59:39.014 --> 59:42.309
was crazy enough to sexually assault a police officer.

738
59:42.392 --> 59:43.727
He was mocking me.

739
59:46.438 --> 59:49.065
Because he's so sure he'll never get caught.

740
59:49.149 --> 59:50.734
[clanging]

741
59:54.654 --> 59:55.780
Stay here.

742
01:00:06.666 --> 01:00:08.418
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

743
01:00:08.501 --> 01:00:09.878
[Jisun] What was that?

744
01:00:09.961 --> 01:00:11.129
Are we okay?

745
01:00:11.212 --> 01:00:12.672
[Hwayoung] I guess it was nothing.

746
01:00:15.425 --> 01:00:16.593
I'll take you home.

747
01:00:17.093 --> 01:00:18.845
[Jisun] It's okay.

748
01:00:19.596 --> 01:00:21.473
[Hwayoung] It's dangerous, and it's getting late.

749
01:00:22.682 --> 01:00:23.808
[Jisun] Thank you.

750
01:00:26.603 --> 01:00:28.438
[door locks]

751
01:01:06.518 --> 01:01:07.644
[Junho] Hello.

752
01:01:09.688 --> 01:01:11.856
[nurse] Dr. Min, have you heard?

753
01:01:11.940 --> 01:01:12.983
Heard what?

754
01:01:14.275 --> 01:01:15.527
[nurse] You haven't heard.

755
01:01:16.987 --> 01:01:18.363
You know, Yunji.

756
01:01:18.863 --> 01:01:20.073
She was in intensive care

757
01:01:20.156 --> 01:01:22.534
because she wasn't recovering well after surgery.

758
01:01:22.617 --> 01:01:23.618
Yes.

759
01:01:25.829 --> 01:01:28.581
She passed away last night.

760
01:01:36.006 --> 01:01:37.757
You know what everyone's saying?

761
01:01:38.425 --> 01:01:41.177
That she'd still be alive if you'd operated on her back then.

762
01:01:41.678 --> 01:01:44.222
All because that woman went around spreading false rumors.

763
01:01:45.640 --> 01:01:47.642
She didn't just make your life miserable.

764
01:01:47.726 --> 01:01:49.269
She's a murderer.

765
01:01:49.352 --> 01:01:50.353
That's…

766
01:01:51.354 --> 01:01:52.772
going a bit too far.

767
01:01:55.066 --> 01:01:56.609
Please be mindful of how you speak.

768
01:01:58.486 --> 01:01:59.487
Okay.

769
01:02:04.909 --> 01:02:06.369
[door slides]

770
01:02:07.829 --> 01:02:09.247
[sighs]

771
01:02:10.707 --> 01:02:11.875
[door closes]

772
01:02:41.821 --> 01:02:43.823
Sir, you can go in now.

773
01:02:46.117 --> 01:02:48.453
[♪ ominous music plays]

774
01:03:32.247 --> 01:03:36.167
THE PERFECT LIE

775
01:04:00.275 --> 01:04:03.611
How do you manage to sleep at night?

776
01:04:03.695 --> 01:04:04.988
[♪ tense music plays]

777
01:04:05.071 --> 01:04:08.741
As you know, there are things we'd never want them to know.

778
01:04:09.367 --> 01:04:10.952
If she doesn't turn herself in,

779
01:04:12.203 --> 01:04:14.080
things will only get worse.

780
01:04:14.831 --> 01:04:17.167
I can't even trust the people I used to trust.

781
01:04:17.250 --> 01:04:18.501
[Junho] I'm giving you a chance.

782
01:04:18.585 --> 01:04:21.045
It's the only way to protect your sister.

783
01:04:22.088 --> 01:04:25.300
[Jieun] You want me to have my own sister committed?

784
01:04:25.383 --> 01:04:28.553
[Jisun] You were the only person in the world I could trust.

785
01:04:28.636 --> 01:04:30.972
So how could you lie to me, Jieun?

786
01:04:35.977 --> 01:04:37.979
[♪ unsettling music plays]

787
01:04:46.237 --> 01:04:47.822
THE PERFECT LIE

788
01:04:47.906 --> 01:04:49.908
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
